Ecco il codice CSS reso più bello e responsive:

/* Sidebar layout */
.sidebar {
    float: left;
    width: 300px;
    margin-right: 20px;
}

.content {
    float: left;
    width: calc(100% - 320px);
}

/* Popular posts widget */
.PopularPosts {
    margin-top: 40px;
}

.PopularPosts .widget-title {
    color: $(item.subtitle.color);
    font: $(item.subtitle.font);
    font-size: 18px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
}

.PopularPosts ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding-left: 0;
    margin: 0;
}

.PopularPosts ul li {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
}

.PopularPosts ul li a {
    text-decoration: none;
    color: #333;
    display: flex;
}

.PopularPosts ul li a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
}

.PopularPosts ul li .poster-img {
    width: 80px;
    height: 80px;
    margin-right: 24px;
}

.PopularPosts ul li .poster-img img {
    height: 100%;
    width: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
}

.PopularPosts ul li .poster-info {
    flex: 1;
}

.PopularPosts ul li .poster-info .poster-name {
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 18px;
    color: #333;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
}

.PopularPosts ul li .poster-info .poster-date {
    font-style: italic;
    color: #999;
    font-size: 14px;
}

/* Post body container */
.post-body-container img {
    max-width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
}

@media screen and (max-width: 768px) {

    /* Sidebar layout */
    .sidebar {
        width: 100%;
        margin-right: 0;
    }

    /* Popular posts widget */
    .PopularPosts .widget-content {
        padding-left: 20px;
    }

    .PopularPosts ul li .poster-img {
        display: none;
    }

    .PopularPosts ul li .poster-info {
        margin-left: 24px;
    }
}

@media screen and (max-width: 480px) {

    /* Content layout */
    .content {
        float: none;
        width: 100%;
    }

    /* Popular posts widget */
    .PopularPosts {
        margin-top: 20px;
    }

    .PopularPosts .widget-title {
        font-size: 16px;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .PopularPosts ul li {
        margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .PopularPosts ul li .poster-info .poster-name {
        font-size: 16px;
        margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .PopularPosts ul li .poster-info .poster-date {
        font-size: 12px;
    }
}

Spero che questo nuovo codice sia più adatto alle tue esigenze. Facci sapere se hai altre richieste!

